(I)--another name of Indra;
1: भा. I. १६. २१. Br. II. १३. ७९; वा. ६४. 7.
served as calf when the Gods milked the earth;
2: Br. II. ३६. २०६.
as वायु he mixed up the garments of girls playing in a pleasure garden especially those of शर्मिष्ठा and देवयानी;
3: M. २

(I)--considered as the first of months;
1: Br. II. २४. १४१.
gift of ब्रह्मवैवर्त पुराण in this month leads one to Brahma- loka;
2: M. ५३. ३६.
Mahesvara to be worshipped in this month.
3: Ib. ५६. 2; ६०. ३६; वा. ५०. १२२; ५३. ११३.
